yagna 0.17.6 (31f5353e 2025-12-22)
Golem network server.

By running this software you declare that you have read, understood and hereby accept the disclaimer and privacy warning
found at https://docs.golem.network/docs/golem/terms

Use RUST_LOG env variable to change log level.

USAGE:
    yagna.exe [FLAGS] [OPTIONS] <SUBCOMMAND>

FLAGS:
        --json       Return results in JSON format
    -h, --help       Prints help information
    -V, --version    Prints version information

OPTIONS:
    -d, --datadir <data-dir>    Service data dir [env: YAGNA_DATADIR]  [default:
                                C:\Users\admin\AppData\Roaming\GolemFactory\yagna\data]
    -g, --gsb-url <gsb-url>     Service Bus (aka GSB) URL [env: GSB_URL]  [default: tcp://127.0.0.1:7464]

SUBCOMMANDS:
    db           Database management
    id           Identity management
    app-key      Application keys management
    version      Yagna version management
    net          Network management
    market       Market management
    activity     Activity management
    payment      Payment management
    consent      Consent management
    service      Core service usage
    extension    Extension management
    help         Prints this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
